{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0FuaW1hdGlvbi8yMDIxLS0yMDI0L1BpbCUyN3MlMjBBZHZlbnR1cmVzJTIwJTI4MjAyMSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Pil's Adventures","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/s460WnGrUOm2v18k39ZfjJF21MU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fofQL71uayzxmHj3YS9HeLoo4SH.jpg","description":"Pil, a little vagabond girl, lives on the streets of the medieval city of Roc-en-Brume, along with her three tame weasels. She survives of food stolen from the castle of the sinister Regent Tristain. One day, to escape his guards, Pil disguises herself as a princess. Thus she embarks upon a mad, delirious adventure, together with Crobar, a big clumsy guard who thinks she's a noble, and Rigolin, a young crackpot jester. Pil is going to have to save Roland, rightful heir to the throne under the curse of a spell. This adventure will turn the entire kingdom upside down, and teach Pil that nobility can be found in all of us.","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Animation","Adventure","Fantasy","Comedy","Animation"],"imdbRating":"6.7","runtime":"85 min","cast":["Kaycie Chase","Pierre Tessier","Enrique Carballido","Paul Borne","Julien Crampon","Gauthier Battoue","Barbara Tissier","Emmanuel Curtil"],"director":["Julien Fournet"],"released":"2021-08-11T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Kaycie Chase","character":"Pil (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ooIErFvITaLJdfEwozvsdySYVNu.jpg"},{"name":"Pierre Tessier","character":"Tristain (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/33Q1dBoqtTiRLy8YFM418iPerQJ.jpg"},{"name":"Enrique Carballido","character":"Le chef des mercenaires (voice)"},{"name":"Paul Borne","character":"Crobar (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vjhn44K5M5A3eSdqslscrNCtBSY.jpg"},{"name":"Julien Crampon","character":"Rigolin (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/d6Gi0u2qXMrd4lXbogCJXagBu5U.jpg"},{"name":"Gauthier Battoue","character":"Roland (voice)","photo":"https